  "description": "Do not fight the trend!",
  "body_html": "<p>I will pick up these 2 stocks this afternoon…I do this to prevent any pump and dump accusations…I will buy AFTER you. </p><p>Sidenote: This ticker popped up on the StockTok screener yesterday, and is already up 18%. It rose while I was editing the video. I will still buy, but please watch the entire video for the strategy about it. </p><p>Before we talk about those stocks, please note….we are only building our bear market strategy. Seeking stocks of weakness. </p><p>4 major variables I want, to begin shorting:</p><ol><li><p>VIX &gt; 22, indicating volatility in the down direction.</p></li><li><p>S&amp;P 500 is making lower lows, indicating the broader market is trending down.</p></li><li><p>A popular stock crashes, devastating a large group of investors. </p></li><li><p>Small caps are below their 200 day moving average. </p></li></ol><p>Then, just like we have specific point entry analysis, SEPA for our bullish stocks, we have it for the down trend. We want to see lower highs forming, and then a break from the consolidation. It will look something like this:</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4TxK!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ccedab8-fe4a-4d7d-8865-e51a54e1b8a8_642x474.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4TxK!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ccedab8-fe4a-4d7d-8865-e51a54e1b8a8_642x474.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!4TxK!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9ccedab8-fe4a-4d7d-8865-e51a54e1b8a8_642x474.png 848w, https://subs