ese are euphoric runs with little fundamentals, and lots of hyped narrative. If you have questions, you can ask me in <a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/eba49e1c-42ba-410f-9f01-4540686d65aa\">the chat, by clicking here</a>. The two stocks I am buying are:</p>",
